      "source": [
        "### Optimizing BERT Fine-tuning on Colab\n",
        "Below is an optimized version of the training loop. Make sure you switch your runtime type to **GPU** (`Runtime` -> `Change runtime type` -> `T4 GPU`) before running this.\n",
        "\n",
        "We introduce:\n",
        "- **`torch.cuda.amp` (Automatic Mixed Precision):** Cuts memory usage in half and accelerates tensor cores.\n",
        "- **DataLoader speedups:** Ensure `pin_memory=True` is configured."
      ]
